  "tags": [
    "Cascade",
    "Demons",
    "Life Drain",
    "Chaos"
  ],
  "strategy": "Abaddon the Despoiler gives every spell cast from hand on its controller's turn cascade, as long as its mana value is no more than the life the opponents have lost this turn, so the deck's first job each turn is to make the table bleed. Great Unclean One, Mortarion, Plague Drone, Keeper of Secrets, Noise Marine, Warstorm Surge and The Ruinous Powers drain and burn the opponents while Heralds of Tzeentch, Deny Reality, Let the Galaxy Burn, Sloppity Bilepiper and Dark Apostle add cascades of their own. Be'lakor and Herald of Slaanesh make the Demons cheaper and faster, Past in Flames, Poxwalkers and Helbrute replay what has already been spent, and Blasphemous Act, Mandate of Abaddon, Chaos Warp, Chaos Mutation, Kill! Maim! Burn! and Bile Blight clear the way.",
